  "text": "Recipe: Corn Beetroot Muffins\nCreator: Mrs N_K Manku\nCategory: Muffin\nIngredients: corn flour, grated beetroot, flaxseed powder, psyllium husk powder, cinnamon powder, pink salt, date paste, raisins, Garlic Herb Bread Mix, Instant Dry Yeast, warm water, sunflower seeds, watermelon seeds, sesame seeds\nCooking methods: bake, air-fry, no-cook\nInstructions: Mix all ingredients to make soft dough. Keep it for 3 to 4 hours in a warm place. Let it rise. Divide the dough in four parts, and give shape. Bake both sides in air fryer for 15 and 10 mins, respectively, at 180 C. Garnish with sunflower seeds, watermelon seeds & sesame seeds.\nNotes: A recipe with WHOLE GRAINS (corn flour), RAINBOW VEGGIES (beetroot), NUTS & SEEDS (flaxseed powder, seeds for garnishing), SWEETENERS (date paste, raisins), MISC (psyllium husk, cinnamon powder, dry yeast, spices).",
